{"sha": "e1605c8bba05730aebabebabb7b3e025a137e0145211e6eb8ca7909bb3838d69", "body": ["\\chapter{测量与时间}\\label{ch:g1:measure}", "", "哪支铅笔更长？今天是星期几？一颗糖多少钱？", "本章比较长度，并用厘米来测量，", "把一周的日子排好顺序，认读钟面上的整时，", "并数一数小面额的硬币。", "", "\\section{长与短}", "", "\\begin{method}[比较长度]\\label{met:g1:measure:compare}", "比较两个长度时，让它们的\\emph{一端对齐}：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 把两个物体并排放好，从同一条线开始；", "  \\item 伸得更远的那个是\\emph{更长}的，另一个是", "        \\emph{更短}的；", "  \\item 如果两者伸到同一处，它们的\\emph{", "        长度相同}。", "\\end{enumerate}", "起点对齐是关键 --- 从起点歪斜处比较，", "很容易让眼睛看错。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0.6) -- (3.4,0.6);", "  \\draw[very thick, omThm] (0,0) -- (2.2,0);", "  \\draw[gray, dashed] (0,-0.2) -- (0,0.8);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (3.6,0.6) {更长};", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (3.6,0) {更短};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两根小棒左端对齐：蓝色的那根伸得更远，", "所以它更长。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[厘米]\\label{def:g1:measure:cm}", "要说明\\emph{有多长}，用尺子以", "\\emph{厘米}（cm）为单位来量。把尺子的 $0$ 刻度对准物体的起点，", "读出物体另一端所对的数。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  % ruler body extends a little past the last mark so no numeral is cut", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.4,0) rectangle (8.4,0.7);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,8} {", "    \\draw[thick] (\\i,0.7) -- (\\i,0.4);", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (\\i,0.2) {\\i};", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omThm] (0,1.15) -- (5,1.15);", "  \\node[omThm, above, font=\\small] at (2.5,1.22) {铅笔：$5$ cm};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 测量：$0$ 对准起点，读终点。这支铅笔", "长 $5$ cm。（毫米和米见", "\\cref{ch:g3:measure}。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{一周的日子}", "", "\\begin{example}[七天]\\label{ex:g1:measure:days}", "一周有 $7$ 天，总是按同一顺序排列：", "\\[", "\\text{星期一、星期二、星期三、星期四、星期五、星期六、", "星期日。}", "\\]", "过了星期日，又从星期一开始。\\emph{昨天}是", "前一天，\\emph{明天}是后一天：如果今天是星期三，", "那么昨天是星期二，明天是星期四。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{钟面上的整时}", "", "\\begin{method}[认读整时]\\label{met:g1:measure:clock}", "长针正指向 $12$ 时，这便是整时：", "读出\\emph{短}针所指的数。短针指向", "$3$，长针指向 $12$：这是 $3$ 点。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.95]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\foreach \\h in {1,...,12} {", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at ({90-\\h*30}:1.05) {\\h};", "    \\draw ({90-\\h*30}:1.22) -- ({90-\\h*30}:1.3);", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- (0:0.62);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) -- (90:1.02);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55) {$3$ 点};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.4cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\foreach \\h in {1,...,12} {", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at ({90-\\h*30}:1.05) {\\h};", "    \\draw ({90-\\h*30}:1.22) -- ({90-\\h*30}:1.3);", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- ({90-8*30}:0.62);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) -- (90:1.02);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55) {$8$ 点};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 整时：长的红色指针指向 $12$，短的蓝色指针", "给出时刻。（半点和一刻见", "\\cref{ch:g2:measure}。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{小面额硬币}", "", "\\begin{example}[凑出一个数额]\\label{ex:g1:measure:coins}", "用 $1$、$2$、$5$ 的硬币，许多数额都能用几种方法凑出。", "要凑出 $7$：", "\\[", "5 + 2, \\qquad", "5 + 1 + 1, \\qquad", "2 + 2 + 2 + 1 .", "\\]", "先取面值最大的硬币，通常是最快的方法，", "所用的硬币数最少。", "\\end{example}", ""]}